116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (Every week we held a Scrum Master review where the current Scrum Master led the session walking through what was completed, identifying blockers, and reprioritizing the backlog for the next sprint. We rotated the Scrum Master role each sprint so every team member had to take ownership of the process and understand the full picture of the project, not just their own tasks.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
117 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (This rotation turned out to be one of the most valuable parts of our workflow. When it was your week to run the review, you had to know what everyone else was building, which pushed better communication across the team.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
