120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 78 0 R
/E (The backend operates on Node.js and Express, using a MySQL database to process real-time game data via an API. To ensure reliability, all critical operations are handled by stored procedures: sp_start_run initializes games, sp_end_run calculates final scores based on victories, rooms cleared, enemies defeated, and damage dealt, while other procedures manage card upgrades, the shop economy, and activity logging.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
