123 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 79 0 R
/T (Views and Analytics)
/E (Views and Analytics)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (To make analytics more accessible, we use a series of SQL views that provide pre-formatted data without needing to access raw tables directly. These views power the frontend admin panel and leaderboards, centralizing the logic within the database rather than spreading it across multiple API routes. For instance, v_user_run_summary and v_run_detail provide history and event timelines, while v_global_stats, v_top_cards, and v_card_win_rate offer deeper insights into player behavior and game balance. We even use a view, v_shop_catalog, to manage the store; by filtering cards with a cost greater than zero, any new item added to the master list automatically appears in the shop, requiring no further code changes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
