129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (The Stats Dashboard reads from v_user_run_summary, v_card_usage, and v_card_win_rate to show each player their personal history: runs completed, best score, most used cards, and win rate by deck composition. The Admin Panel gives authorized users access to global stats via v_global_stats and v_top_cards, and lets them inspect any active run through v_active_runs and v_run_detail.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
