133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Merge conflicts: Working on parallel branches \(cards, rooms, enemies\) caused constant conflicts when merging. We fixed this by establishing a mandatory PR workflow, nobody merges without team review, and by splitting modules with clear interfaces to reduce collisions.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Sprites: Spritesheets were not rendering correctly. Offsets were miscalculated, animations were out of sync, and sizes were inconsistent across characters. We built a  tool to visualize individual frames and standardized all sizes in a constants file.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Lack of communication: There were sprints where everyone worked in isolation and we ended up duplicating code or building incompatible functions. We addressed this with short daily check-ins, even if just a quick message, and used the GitHub Projects board so everyone could see what the others were working on.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
